        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sherwood Stewart, Ekaterina Makarova, Nduka Odizor, Van Winitsky, Steve Denton\n- Events: 1983 Dallas Open – Doubles\n- Places: Goose Creek, Texas, United States\n- Roles: amateur tennis player, professional tennis player\n\nFacts:\n- Sherwood Stewart was born on June 6, 1946, in Goose Creek, Texas, United States.\n- Sherwood Stewart played amateur and professional tennis in the 1970s and 1980s.\n- Nduka Odizor and Van Winitsky won the 1983 Dallas Open – Doubles final by defeating Steve Denton and Sherwood Stewart 6–3, 7–5.\n- Ekaterina Valeryevna Makarova was born on June 7, 1988.\n- Ekaterina Makarova is a Russian professional tennis player.",
